00:13:55.000 --> 00:13:56.770
So she has no interest in, I'm always like

00:13:56.770 --> 00:13:58.160
let's sell slime or this and that.

00:13:58.160 --> 00:13:58.993
She's like no.

00:13:58.993 --> 00:14:00.830
I'm like great, awesome, you do you.

00:14:00.830 --> 00:14:02.910
Showing a little bit of
an ability to flip cards

00:14:02.910 --> 00:14:04.510
