00:14:47.920 --> 00:14:49.400
That's really it, that's it.

00:14:49.400 --> 00:14:51.763
As far as like when it clicked for me.

00:14:53.490 --> 00:14:54.870
It clicked in a couple different ways.

00:14:54.870 --> 00:14:57.160
I remember the first day literally.

00:14:57.160 --> 00:14:58.860
Oh, god, I'm getting really
