It's not even close.

00:18:02.910 --> 00:18:03.920
- Arbitrage, I mean, it's your thing.

00:18:03.920 --> 00:18:05.011
- Arbitrage.

00:18:05.011 --> 00:18:05.844
(laughing)

00:18:05.844 --> 00:18:07.760
It's just buying and
selling gives me a high

00:18:07.760 --> 00:18:10.393
