00:21:13.237 --> 00:21:15.230
Like, recognize what we're doing

00:21:15.230 --> 00:21:18.503
and so for me, I'm
putting, you know, when I.

00:21:18.503 --> 00:21:19.980
I think this morning on the way

00:21:19.980 --> 00:21:21.950
to the shower I tweeted a blue heart.

00:21:21.950 --> 00:21:22.909
That was it.

00:21:22.909 --> 00:21:24.730
And like, and that's just nice.

00:21:24.730 --> 00:21:25.833
- And the internet went wild!

00:21:25.833 --> 00:21:27.570
- I mean, I don't know if they went wild

00:21:27.570 --> 00:21:29.700
but I think one human seeing that

00:21:29.700 --> 00:21:31.293
maybe just thought that's nice.

00:21:32.170 --> 00:21:34.250
To me, we need to start doing that.

00:21:34.250 --> 00:21:36.290
We need to make like,
maybe this is the podcast,

00:21:36.290 --> 00:21:37.410
this is the moment.

00:21:37.410 --> 00:21:39.810
Let's make a call to arms, like if you're

00:21:39.810 --> 00:21:42.189
